<title>USA: TABLE-FCB Financial Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FCB Financial Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OSHKOSH, Wis. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in Thousands, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>							 1997(a)	 1996</p>
<p>Selected Operations Data</p>
<p> Interest and dividend income		$8,376	  $4,853</p>
<p> Interest expense				 4,696	   2,617</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses			500		50</p>
<p> Noninterest income				 633	     175</p>
<p> Operating expenses			     1,962	   1,122</p>
<p> Merger-related expenses			  827		 0</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		     334	     481</p>
<p> Net income					   690	     672</p>
<p>Selected Financial</p>
<p>Ratios and Other Data</p>
<p> Return on average assets		     0.63%	   1.17%</p>
<p> Return on average equity		     4.10%	   6.44%</p>
<p> Net interest spread			    2.65%	   2.72%</p>
<p> Net interest margin			    3.43%	   3.62%</p>
<p> Non-performing assets to total assets    0.13%	   0.12%</p>
<p> Allowance for loan losses to loans	 0.83%	   0.51%</p>
<p> Shares outstanding			 4,073,147     2,459,614</p>
<p> Earnings per share				0.20	    0.31</p>
<p> Dividends declared per share		  0.18	    0.18</p>
<p> Book Value per share			   18.80	   18.97</p>
<p>						     As of	    As of</p>
<p> Selected Financial Data		  6/30/97	   3/31/97</p>
<p> Total assets				 $526,203	 $271,185</p>
<p> Loans receivable - net		    398,630	  221,496</p>
<p> Loans held for sale - net		   4,861	    3,270</p>
<p> Deposit accounts			    317,629	  153,163</p>
<p> Borrowed funds				117,160	   64,900</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity			 76,556	   47,432</p>
<p> Mortgage loans serviced for others    228,492	  127,334</p>
<p>(a) On May 1, 1997 the corporation merged with OSB Financial Corp. Therefore, operating results for the latest quarter include results of OSB Financial Corp and subsidiaries from May 1, 1997. Prior period results have not been restated as the merger was accounted for using the purchase method of accounting.</p>
<p>Periods ended June 30.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
